# Supabase — the shared source of truth for the demo.
# Both apps point at the same project on purpose: that is the whole point.
# The publishable (anon) key is safe in a client; it can only read, and every write
# goes through the security-definer functions in supabase/migrations/0002_rls_and_rpcs.sql.
# The demo project's values are committed in .env so a fresh clone runs with no setup.
